<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine M2 rises to 10.04 bln hryvnias end-April.</title>
<headline>Ukraine M2 rises to 10.04 bln hryvnias end-April.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine M2 money supply grew to 10.04 billion hryvnias on April 30 from 9.51 billion hryvnias on March 31, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>				     APR 30 '97   MAR 31 '97  APR 30 '96</p>
<p> M2 (billion hryvnias)	  10.04	   9.51 R	7.18</p>
<p> M2 growth mth/mth (pct)	+6.0	    +5.0	  +1.0</p>
<p> M0 (billion hryvnias)	   4.76	   4.30	  1.91</p>
<p>NOTE - The bank previously said M2 at the end of March was 9.59 billion hryvnias.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
